    {
      "text": "I’m just calling out what I see with a failure in corporate communication, when so much is at stake.\n\nI’m really not sure why SK Hynix/Samsung representing SK’s economy let narratives of memory oversupply be dominated by their own customers on X.\n\nOr why $CBRS, which lost billions in valuation after the short seller report, is waiting for an analyst question in earnings to fix the damage \n\nOr why many of the “guppies” that would face a death in the Neocloud market aren’t actively fighting back against that claim here.\n\nA lot of narratives and claims originated and were distributed via X.\n\nEven",
